Rule 2 (mat1 and mat2 must have compatible shapes for matrix multiplication)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)
