Rule 3 (input, mat1 and mat2 should have same dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_3)
>>
Rule 4 (alpha and beta should be numbers greater than or equal to 0)
{v_1 : float ⊎ int, v_2 : float ⊎ int} |= v_1 ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 5 (output tensor shape is compatible with input shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_4 : tensor} |= ndim(v_4) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_4, i) = shape(v_1, i)
