Rule 10 (The rows of mat1 and input should be the same)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 11 (Number of columns of mat2 is same as number of columns of input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1)
